Add your own agents on your computer in custom_agents.json: run any ACP agent by its command, or enable any agent from the ACP registry by id. Each paired computer remembers its own agents and the one you last picked. Agents can suggest a follow-up task as a card; tap it to start a new session. Settings can be opened while the app is still connecting. Fixed the missing Quote item on Android. Completion notifications on iOS are now localized. Requires agentdeckd 0.8.0.